{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13448","headline":"变律 三 · 苏涣","name":"变律 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养蚕爲素丝，叶尽蚕不老。\n倾筐对空林，此意向谁道。\n一女不得织，万夫受其寒。\n一夫不得意，四海行路难。\n祸亦不在大，福亦不在先。\n世路险孟门，吾徒当勉旃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}